  "scope": "Windows/Linux each pass 22 native suites, three existing standalone C++ workflow/batch/RGB UI probes, one installed public C++ SDK consumer exercising the new RGB histogram job and Auto decision, ten background repetitions, four hidden GL contexts and 12185 installed Python checks, zero failure/error/skip. The 6747 new cases include 6160 actual ImageJ raw plot/Auto histogram, decision/cycle and mapped-output rows, 22 core strict/admission/callback/weight/job cases, 560 editor reference rows and five repeated-cycle/reset/superseded-intent cases. Reference harness executes pinned ContrastAdjuster plotHistogram and autoAdjust plus actual ColorProcessor/ColorStatistics; AWT construction and scrollbar presentation are bypassed without patching upstream processing sources. Primary plots count whole planes; intensity plots use active area membership. Auto always measures baseline weighted intensity and previews whole-plane mapping with selected component bits. Preference weights, repeated cycle and stale/cancel/close/reset paths are connected through the shared ImGui panel. Histograms and Auto do not change document pixels/display/history before Apply. Leased HistogramJob is reused with typed/base aliases and Python owning copies. Native fixtures exercise cancellation on a blocked worker, no creator-thread reads, retained aliases after completion/shutdown, and real mouse-click Auto/Apply/Undo. Admission is metadata-only and bounds native payloads; external caches/RSS remain outside scope. Actual compiled inputs and installed origins are pinned; a SHA-verified native Linux snapshot contains 5471 test/config/fixture files. Two test-only corrections adapt new assertions to the existing histogram dictionary/NumPy API; original variants and failed reports are retained. Exact owned scratch including disposable environments, test fixtures and Java class directories is CRC/member-SHA archived before deletion. Scalar/RGB Apply headers and wire profiles, original 99 requirement/status triples and commercial-use inventory remain unchanged. Exact ImageJ component-switch snapshot promotion, active/stack narrowing, slider/log-plot/Set/reset/calibration, RGBA/floating Apply and complete G057/ImageJ/Fiji/platform/resource acceptance remain open. Existing Auto producer-source gate is unchanged.",
